Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Japanese text placement in menus
Applies after 0078-japanese-pokedex-units.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Smaller differences of text the Japanese ROM places in code: the summary's
portrait panel (level and nickname above, the species and gender beside the ball)
and its texts a pixel lower, the held item and ribbon count left-aligned; yes/no
boxes a pixel lower; the party's action menu two tiles narrower; the Match Call
list's class and name in fixed columns. Other languages are unchanged.

